                                "sense_id": "6816ff36-2661-3096-a040-7617e92bb94c",
                                "text": "Tiro, the favourite freedman of Cicero, greatly increased the number, and brought this sort of tachygraphy to its greatest perfection among the Romans."
                            }
                        ]
